  b="FoRT had shown that 4 Gy is inferior to 24 Gy for local control in indolent lymphoma overall, but with far less toxicity.",
  i="Showed that most patients with gastric MALT lymphoma can be controlled with 4 Gy, keeping 20 Gy for those who need it.",
